Vendored fonts for protocol PDFs. The server reads these files from disk when a
protocol contains characters the standard PDF fonts cannot encode. It does not
download fonts when a protocol is requested.

NotoSans-Regular.ttf
NotoSans-Bold.ttf
  Upstream hinted static builds of Noto Sans.
  https://github.com/notofonts/notofonts.github.io/tree/main/fonts/NotoSans/hinted/ttf
  License: OFL-NotoSans.txt

NotoSansSC-Regular.ttf
  Static weight-400 instance of the Google Fonts Noto Sans SC variable font
  (https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/notosanssc), produced with
  fonttools varLib.instancer at wght=400. The upstream copyright reserves the
  font name Source. This file is not named Source.
  License: OFL-NotoSansSC.txt

NotoEmoji-Regular.ttf
  Static weight-400 instance of the Google Fonts Noto Emoji variable font
  (https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/notoemoji), produced with
  fonttools varLib.instancer at wght=400.
  License: OFL-NotoEmoji.txt
